  "details": "in the condition below, Additive Animation Layer causes continuous movement.\n- an avatar has non-humanoid bone that is a child of a humanoid bone, and this bone has non-zero local position\n- Base or Additive Playable Layer animator controller captures that bone\n- Gesture Playable Layer animator controller has a layer with Additive Blending, and its state is not Write Defaults\n- the avatar has FX PlayableLayer\nminimum sample is here : https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TOvcEOFAP9z6GYWDuwkgVr_5OHpZgoYi/view?usp=sharing\nin this package, avatar named \"Block Man AutoRigged Humanoid\" is placed and its bone \"Armature/Sphere\" will fly over",
